    <p class="lede">Hard water is a silent killer for modern water heaters. HPWHs and tankless units use smaller-diameter, higher-temperature heat exchangers than traditional tank elements — they scale faster. This guide explains when softening or filtration is worth it, the salt-based vs salt-free debate, and how to size the system for your water hardness.</p>
